OL,3,GNEWSAThe firms coping in the wake of
OL,4,Athe Rettendon blast
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shop owner whose building was caught
OL,7,Fup in a huge explosion says it is not
OL,8,Fthe fire, but the finances, that have
OL,9,Fleft his business in ruins.
OL,11,FMore than 100 firefighters tackled a
OL,12,Fmassive fire at an industrial unit near
OL,13,FRettendon in Essex on 24 July, which
OL,14,Ftriggered a huge explosion at a
OL,15,Ffertiliser store at Highlands Farm.
OL,17,FTony Brazao's business, Coral Passion,
OL,18,Flost "several hundred" fish, shrimp and
OL,19,Fcoral, and the property wall and power
OL,20,Fsupply were also damaged.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
