OL,3,GNEWSAThe firms coping in the wake of
OL,4,Athe Rettendon blast
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite costs "well into six figures",
OL,7,Fhe claims insurers MSIG have been
OL,8,F"unwilling" to pay out more than
OL,9,F#15,000. The firm would not comment on
OL,10,Findividual cases but said all concerns
OL,11,Fwere "considered carefully".
